#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1498
msgid "AI Limits & Security"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1502
msgid "Cap how much AI usage the site can generate and restrict which user roles may trigger paid AI calls. Sits on top of the per-user rate limit (30 requests / minute, hardcoded) that already protects against single-user runaway loops."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1511
msgid "Daily request limit"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1526
msgid "Site-wide ceiling on AI requests per UTC day (counts both Toolbar translations and block revisions). Counter resets at UTC midnight. Set to 0 to disable the cap."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1535
msgid "Minimum role"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1555
msgid "Lowest WordPress capability allowed to trigger AI features. Tightening this on multi-author sites prevents Contributors or trial accounts from running paid AI calls. Override per-feature via the linguaforge_required_capability filter."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1564
msgid "Translation Limits"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1568
msgid "Control how much content is sent to the AI and how large the response can be. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). Raise these values if large pages are being cut off; lower them to reduce API costs."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1577
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1671
msgid "Model tier"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1589
msgid "Quality (default — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1592
msgid "Light (fast and cost-effective — Haiku / Flash)"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1597
msgid "Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and the content is short."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1606
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1700
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1761
msgid "Max output tokens"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1623
msgid "Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response. If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. Default: 16 000."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1632
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1724
msgid "Max input characters"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1649
msgid "Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1658
msgid "Quick Translation"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1662
msgid "Quick Translation is used for snippet/chunk mode — short passages translated on demand from the toolbar, editor, or block popovers. It uses a separate, lighter configuration from the full-page translation to keep responses fast and cost-effective."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1683
msgid "Light (default — fast and cost-effective)"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1686
msgid "Quality (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1691
msgid "The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above (default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation accuracy as full-page mode for snippets."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1716
msgid "Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1740
msgid "Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1748
msgid "Content Generator"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1752
msgid "Controls the token budget and input limits for the AI Content Generator feature. Leave fields blank to use the built-in defaults."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1777
msgid "Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1785
msgid "Max hints characters"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1801
msgid "Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1809
msgid "Max context characters"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1825
msgid "Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1838
msgid "Block Editor"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1842
msgid "LinguaForge restricts two Gutenberg features by default to keep editorial behavior consistent across languages. Opt in here when you need full Gutenberg / FSE capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1849
msgid "Block locking"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1859
msgid "Allow editors to lock individual blocks"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1862
msgid "Re-enables Gutenberg's canLockBlocks. Useful for editorial templates that need to prevent contributors from moving or deleting specific blocks."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1868
msgid "Template mode"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1878
msgid "Allow Gutenberg template-editing mode on post screens"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1881
msgid "Re-enables supportsTemplateMode. Core to Full-Site-Editing workflows where post-level template overrides are intentional."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1888
msgid "Compliance Preset"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1892
msgid "Strict-preservation mode for legal, regulatory, medical, or technical content. When on, every AI feature uses a low sampling temperature and appends the addendum below to its system prompt — terminology, article numbers, units, brand names, and regulatory language are preserved verbatim rather than paraphrased."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1900
msgid "Global AI preset"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: sampling temperature value, e.g. 0.2
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1915
#, php-format
msgid "T=%s"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1922
msgid "Sets the default AI behaviour for all features site-wide. Individual posts can override this for Translation and Content Generation via the LinguaForge AI meta box."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1929
msgid "Custom system-prompt addendum"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1938
msgid "Leave blank to use the preset's built-in instructions."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1941
msgid "When non-empty, this text replaces the active preset's built-in system-prompt addendum. Use it to add domain-specific instructions (e.g. renewable-energy abbreviations, proprietary brand names, regulatory citation formats). Leave blank to use the preset default."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1948
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1959
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:2378
msgid "Translation Memory"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1952
msgid "Cache translated equivalents at the block level so reusable content (shared footers, sidebars, accordions, boilerplate-heavy legal sections) does not pay an API call every time. When enabled, the translation flow parses each post into blocks, looks each block up in the cache, and sends only uncached blocks to the AI in a single batched request. Glossary edits and Compliance preset changes automatically invalidate affected cached translations. View statistics and clear the cache under Maintenance."
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1969
msgid "Enable block-level translation cache reuse across posts"
msgstr ""

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:1972
msgid "Currently skipped for posts that use block-comment attribute placeholders (wp:details summary fields, etc.) — they fall through to the existing single-call translation path."
msgstr ""

